 high position.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَرَفَعْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"And We raised him","transliteration":"warafaʿnāhu","verse_key":"19:57"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَكَانًا","en_gloss":"(to) a position","transliteration":"makānan","verse_key":"19:57"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلِيًّا","en_gloss":"high","transliteration":"ʿaliyyan","verse_key":"19:57"},{"pos":4,"ar":"٥٧","en_gloss":"(57)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"19:57"}]},{"verse_key":"19:58","surah":19,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَنْعَمَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهِم مِّنَ ٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ مِن ذُرِّيَّةِ ءَادَمَ وَمِمَّنْ حَمَلْنَا مَعَ نُوحٍ وَمِن ذُرِّيَّةِ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَإِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ وَمِمَّنْ هَدَيْنَا وَٱجْتَبَيْنَآ ۚ إِذَا تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ ءَايَـٰتُ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ خَرُّوا۟ سُجَّدًا وَبُكِيًّا ۩","en_translation_id":85,"en":"These were the prophets God blessed- from the seed of Adam, of those We carried in the Ark with Noah, from the seed of Abraham and Israel- and those We guided and chose. When the revelations of the Lord of Mercy were recited to them, they fell to their knees and wept,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"19:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(were) the ones whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"19:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنْعَمَ","en_gloss":"Allah bestowed favor","transliteration":"anʿama","verse_key":"19:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah bestowed favor","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"19:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَيْهِم","en_gloss":"upon them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"19:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from (among)","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"19:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ","en_gloss":"the Prophets","transliteration":"l-nabiyīna","verse_key":"19:58"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"19:58"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ذُرِّيَّةِ","en_gloss":"(the) offspring","transliteration":"dhurriyyati","verse_key":"19:58"},{"pos":10,"ar