y":"19:58"},{"pos":30,"ar":"٥٨","en_gloss":"(58)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"19:58"}]},{"verse_key":"19:59","surah":19,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"۞ فَخَلَفَ مِنۢ بَعْدِهِمْ خَلْفٌ أَضَاعُوا۟ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَٱتَّبَعُوا۟ ٱلشَّهَوَٰتِ ۖ فَسَوْفَ يَلْقَوْنَ غَيًّا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but there came after them generations who neglected prayer and were driven by their own desires. These will come face to face with their evil,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ فَخَلَفَ","en_gloss":"Then succeeded","transliteration":"fakhalafa","verse_key":"19:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after them","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"19:59"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَعْدِهِمْ","en_gloss":"after them","transliteration":"baʿdihim","verse_key":"19:59"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَلْفٌ","en_gloss":"successors","transliteration":"khalfun","verse_key":"19:59"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَضَاعُوا۟","en_gloss":"who neglected","transliteration":"aḍāʿū","verse_key":"19:59"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","verse_key":"19:59"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱتَّبَعُوا۟","en_gloss":"and they followed","transliteration":"wa-ittabaʿū","verse_key":"19:59"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلشَّهَوَٰتِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the lusts","transliteration":"l-shahawāti","verse_key":"19:59"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَسَوْفَ","en_gloss":"so soon","transliteration":"fasawfa","verse_key":"19:59"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَلْقَوْنَ","en_gloss":"they will meet","transliteration":"yalqawna","verse_key":"19:59"},{"pos":11,"ar":"غَيًّا","en_gloss":"evil","transliteration":"ghayyan","verse_key":"19:59"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٥٩","en_gloss":"(59)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"19:59"}]},{"verse_key":"19:60","surah":19,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"إِلَّا مَن تَابَ وَءَامَنَ وَعَمِلَ صَـٰلِحًا فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ يَدْخُلُونَ ٱلْجَنَّةَ وَلَا يُظْلَمُونَ شَيْـًٔا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but those who repent, who believe, who do righteous deeds, will enter Paradise. They will not be wronged in the least:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"E